{
  "//": [
    "Runtime module resolution for the compiled API (V3.1 Phase F).",
    "",
    "tsconfig.base.json maps @beauclick/* to each package SOURCE (src/index.ts).",
    "That is right for tests and for api:dev, and unusable at runtime: Node",
    "cannot execute TypeScript. This is the same table with every target",
    "rewritten to its compiled output under dist/.",
    "",
    "baseUrl is ../.. and NOT \".\": tsconfig-paths resolves baseUrl relative to",
    "THIS FILE, so \".\" would look for /app/infra/docker/dist/... , miss, and",
    "fall through to node_modules -- where each workspace package main points",
    "back at src/index.ts and the process dies on the first import.",
    "",
    "Generated from tsconfig.base.json. Regenerate it when a path mapping is",
    "added; infra/docker/Dockerfile.api asserts the API can start with it."
  ],
  "compilerOptions": {
    "baseUrl": "../..",
    "paths": {
      "@beauclick/auth": [
        "dist/libs/auth/src/index.js"
      ],
      "@beauclick/ownership": [
        "dist/libs/ownership/src/index.js"
      ],
      "@beauclick/audit": [
        "dist/libs/audit/src/index.js"
